 invented here, set by nobody, so its absence IS known.)

a list called gen_environment_variable_names is ["HOME", "USER", "SHELL", "PATH", "PWD", "LANG", "TERM", "LOGNAME", "TMPDIR", "EDITOR", "HOSTNAME", "DISPLAY", "XDG_RUNTIME_DIR", "LC_ALL", "TZ", "MAIL"].

a boolean called gen_environment_last_name_is_unset is false.

To 'gen environment variable name'.
