(TIM-44 (LANGUAGE.md:4556-4564, undocumented - Discrepancy 5): the time
 components are UTC. `hour`, `minute` and `second` agree exactly with
 the UTC decomposition of `unix` - the strongest oracle in this section,
 needing no reference clock at all. D5.vox (mapping worker) checked only
 `hour`; this leaf checks all three in one reading.)

