    a text called 'the hour shown' is 'gen buffer slot of' of 'the hour expr'.
    a text called 'the hour check' is 'gen assert time matches' of "TIM-44" and "{stem}'s hour" and 'the hour expr' and 'the hour shown'.
    a text called 'the minute expr' is "{stem}'s unix modulo 3600 divide 60".
    a text called 'the minute shown' is 'gen buffer slot of' of 'the minute expr'.
    a text called 'the minute check' is 'gen assert time matches' of "TIM-44" and "{stem}'s minute" and 'the minute expr' and 'the minute shown'.
    a text called 'the second expr' is "{stem}'s unix modulo 60".
    a text called 'the second shown' is 'gen buffer slot of' of 'the second expr'.
    a text called 'the second check' is 'gen assert time matches' of "TIM-44" and "{stem}'s second" and 'the second expr' and 'the second shown'.
    a list called 'the lines' is ['the get line', 'the hour check', 'the minute check', 'the second check'].
    'gen join lines' of indent and nested and 'the lines'.

(TIM-45 (LANGUAGE.md:4645-4646, undocumented - Discrepancy 2): `duration`
