    a text called 'the end time check' is 'gen assert time bounded' of "TIM-46" and "{stem}'s end time" and "0" and "0".
    a text called 'the duration check' is 'gen assert time bounded' of "TIM-46" and "{stem}'s duration in milliseconds" and "0" and "0".
    a text called 'the running before check' is 'gen assert false' of "TIM-46" and "{stem}'s running".
    a list called 'the head lines' is ['the creation line', 'the start time check', 'the end time check', 'the duration check', 'the running before check'].
    'gen join lines' of indent and nested and 'the head lines'.
