    a text called 'the hour shown' is 'gen buffer slot of' of 'the hour expr'.
    a text called 'the hour check' is 'gen assert time matches' of "TIM-57" and "{stem}'s hour" and 'the hour expr' and 'the hour shown'.
    a text called 'the literal shown' is "{'the literal'}".
